    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112615" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like leaves,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.13.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.80
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>belonging to leaves,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.8.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having petalled flowers,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.8.3
			</span></i>.</div>
